cmu-job-supervisors-aegis = AEGIS Armaments Strategic Operations Division

cmu-ghost-role-information-aegis-rules = You are a member of [color=red][bold]AEGIS Armaments[/bold][/color]. You are not hostile to any faction.
    You don't remember any of your previous life, and you don't remember anything you learned as a ghost.
    You are allowed to remember knowledge about the game in general, such as how to cook, how to use objects, etc.
    You are absolutely [color=red]NOT[/color] allowed to remember, say, the name, appearance, etc. of your previous character.
    The AEGIS platform and its telemetry are company property. Safeguard them above all else.

# ├──[ Researcher ]──────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
cmu-job-name-aegis-researcher = AEGIS Researcher
cmu-job-prefix-aegis-researcher = AEGIS
cmu-job-description-aegis-researcher = A field researcher from the R&D Division of AEGIS Armaments.
    Oversee the recovery and field evaluation of the AEG-538-KRA strategic weapons platform, preserve its deployment telemetry, and ensure the asset and its authorization key never fall into hostile hands.
cmu-ghost-name-aegis-researcher = AEGIS Researcher
cmu-ghost-role-information-aegis-researcher-description = An AEGIS Armaments researcher attached to the operation. The KRAKEN platform remains AEGIS property. Supervise its handling, collect the deployment data, and answer to Strategic Operations.

# ├──[ Lead Researcher ]─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
cmu-job-name-aegis-lead-researcher = AEGIS Lead Researcher
cmu-job-prefix-aegis-lead-researcher = AEGIS-L
cmu-job-description-aegis-lead-researcher = Head of the AEGIS Armaments R&D field team.
    Directs the recovery and field evaluation of the AEG-538-KRA strategic weapons platform and answers directly to Strategic Operations.
cmu-ghost-name-aegis-lead-researcher = AEGIS Lead Researcher
cmu-ghost-role-information-aegis-lead-researcher-description = The senior researcher of the AEGIS R&D field team. Coordinate your researchers, keep the KRAKEN evaluation on schedule, and report the results to Strategic Operations.

# ├──[ Observer ]────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
cmu-job-name-aegis-observer = AEGIS Observer
cmu-job-prefix-aegis-observer = AEGIS-O
cmu-job-description-aegis-observer = A senior observer from the Strategic Operations Division of AEGIS Armaments.
    Attached to the operation to witness the field evaluation of the AEG-538-KRA platform firsthand. All deployment data must be preserved for post-operation analysis.
cmu-ghost-name-aegis-observer = AEGIS Observer
cmu-ghost-role-information-aegis-observer-description = A Strategic Operations observer from AEGIS Armaments, here to watch the KRAKEN's field evaluation in person. You outrank the research team. High-Command is watching, and the asset must not disappoint.
